Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:12:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1353/3799] soh: rename func_80A8F320 -> EnKakasi_Dance

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: turns each ocarina note into a dance move -- spin on A, faster or slower playback on the C-up and C-down notes, lean on C-left and C-right -- ramping up to a jump once eight notes have been played; its argument makes it pick random notes instead, for the playback.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Kakasi/z_en_kakasi.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Kakasi/z_en_kakasi.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Kakasi/z_en_kakasi.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Kakasi/z_en_kakasi.c
index 99d1858f6..289141d12 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Kakasi/z_en_kakasi.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Kakasi/z_en_kakasi.c
@@ -93,7 +93,8 @@ void EnKakasi_ReturnToRest(EnKakasi* this) {
     Math_SmoothStepToS(&this->actor.shape.rot.z, this->rot.z, 5, 0x2710, 0);
 }
 
-void func_80A8F320(EnKakasi* this, PlayState* play, s16 arg) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80A8F320: turns each ocarina note into a dance move -- spin on A, faster or slower playback on the C-up and C-down notes, lean on C-left and C-right -- ramping up to a jump once eight notes have been played; its argument makes it pick random notes instead, for the playback.
+void EnKakasi_Dance(EnKakasi* this, PlayState* play, s16 arg) {
     s16 ocarinaNote = play->msgCtx.lastOcaNoteIdx;
     s16 currentFrame;
 
@@ -253,7 +254,7 @@ void func_80A8F8D0(EnKakasi* this, PlayState* play) {
             this->actionFunc = func_80A8F660;
         }
     } else if (play->msgCtx.ocarinaMode == OCARINA_MODE_01) {
-        func_80A8F320(this, play, 0);
+        EnKakasi_Dance(this, play, 0);  // was func_80A8F320 [LLM:HIGH]
         player->stateFlags2 |= PLAYER_STATE2_NEAR_OCARINA_ACTOR;
     }
 }
@@ -278,7 +279,7 @@ void func_80A8F9C8(EnKakasi* this, PlayState* play) {
 
 void func_80A8FAA4(EnKakasi* this, PlayState* play) {
     if (play->msgCtx.ocarinaMode != OCARINA_MODE_0F) {
-        func_80A8F320(this, play, 1);
+        EnKakasi_Dance(this, play, 1);  // was func_80A8F320 [LLM:HIGH]
         return;
     }
 
